  m_Name: Cannonball
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  spellName: Cannonball
  description: 'Strike your target for 1x weapon damage and hurl it away at force
    20. A body thrown that hard hits whatever is in its path: each body it strikes
    is hurt for 1% of its max health per unit of speed above 3 (up to 25%), staggers
    for a quarter second, and is thrown on in turn, so a line of enemies falls like
    dominoes. Into the arena wall it slams for 1.5% per unit of speed and bounces
    back. Your own side is never hurt by your throws.'
  cooldown: 8
  range: 2
  alwaysOn: 0
